    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast back into the 2000s with a brand new puzzle-adventure game with a side of platforming! Guide protagonists Victoria, Xenu, Lily, and Jerone through all 30 levels (6 worlds), as they become more familiar with the new world they have found themselves into!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With soundtracks from artist Carboluka (You can find them on bluesky and newgrounds), creating soundtracks for all 6 worlds in the game! I appreciate it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Demo 1, this contains World 1, with a (pretty close to finish) demo of Level 1! All the other levels are merely tech-demos and will be updated in future releases!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast back into the 2000s with a brand new puzzle-adventure game with a side of platforming! Guide protagonists Victoria, Xenu, Lily, and Jerone through all 30 levels (6 worlds), as they become more familiar with the new world they have found themselves into!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With soundtracks from artist Carboluka (You can find them on bluesky and newgrounds), creating soundtracks for all 6 worlds in the game! I appreciate it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Demo 1, this contains World 1, with a (pretty close to finish) demo of Level 1! All the other levels are merely tech-demos and will be updated in future releases!</p>",
